  "description": "The Ecoco has been spotted alongside trendsetters all over the world. It makes running errands fun. It’s the perfect boardwalk beach cruiser and it doesn’t have to worry about fitting into a bathing suit. Its eye-catching paint on its low-slung step-through frame is a showstopper, and its Shimano E6100 motor ensures that you’ll make it to the top of that big hill in time to watch every single sunset. Dependable shifting and disc brakes will keep all the moving parts running smoothly. It comes with fenders, front and rear lights, and a kickstand. The only thing needed, is you!",
